  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Air-fried zucchini chips are a light, crispy snack that transforms simple zucchini into something truly irresistible. Seasoned with smoky paprika, garlic, and a touch of lemon zest, these golden rounds come out of the air fryer perfectly crunchy and full of flavor. Ready in just minutes, they make a quick, guilt-free treat that’s as fun to eat as it is easy to prepare. Pair them with a creamy yogurt herb dip or enjoy them straight from the basket—either way, air-fried zucchini chips are a delicious option for movie nights, parties, or healthy snacking any day of the week.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-crispy-air-fried-zucchini-chips\">Why You’ll Love This Crispy Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-crispy-air-fried-zucchini-chips\">How to Make  Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-crispy-air-fried-zucchini-chips\">Pro Tips for Making Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-crispy-air-fried-zucchini-chips\">How to Serve this Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-crispy-air-fried-zucchini-chips\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Crispy Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Guilt-free snacking that satisfies your crunch cravings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with just a few simple ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly seasoned for a burst of flavor in every bite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Low in calories but high in satisfaction.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A great way to sneak in some veggies for the whole family!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3921\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3921\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Healthy-Snack-Crispy-Air-Fried-Zucchini-Chips.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Crispy air-fried zucchini chips served with a creamy dip on a rustic table.\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Healthy-Snack-Crispy-Air-Fried-Zucchini-Chips.webp 500w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Healthy-Snack-Crispy-Air-Fried-Zucchini-Chips-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Healthy-Snack-Crispy-Air-Fried-Zucchini-Chips-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Crispy Air-Fried Zucchini Chips</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-te